          "content": "<h2>PASSAGE 1: The Fruitful Visit</h2><p>Last week, Manya visited his grandparents' **FARM**. He found his **relatives** busy with various **chores**. His aunt was peeling matooke while his uncle was vaccinating the cattle. Manya was very **interested** in the process. He realized that if he **had come** earlier, he **would have helped** with the harvest.</p>"
