          "content": "<h2>PASSAGE 3: A Lesson in Humility</h2><p>Manya had scoffed at the idea of **chores**, thinking they were **exhausting** and beneath him. He was quickly **chastened** when he saw his grandmother, frail but determined, **washing** all the family clothes by hand. If he **had not seen** her working so hard, he **might have refused** to help. He felt a deep sense of humility and spent the rest of the day enthusiastically helping with the farming **routine**.</p>"
        },
